+The system keeps a veterinary clinic's records. It holds the people who bring animals in, the animals themselves, the appointments those animals attend, and the clinicians the clinic employs. Staff work with it through a browser. They look an owner up by name, then open that owner's record to see every pet and every past appointment. From there they add a pet or book the next visit. A separate page lists the clinic's veterinarians and the specialties they hold, and another lists each specialty with the veterinarians holding it.
 
